:: StoryTitle
Night Signal: SugarCube Runtime Lab

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "B0E61CD4-64A9-49B2-A770-36F500A20EE1",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.36.1",
  "start": "Signal Deck",
  "tag-colors": {
    "opening": "blue",
    "relay": "purple",
    "contact": "orange"
  },
  "zoom": 1
}

:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
html,
body {
  background: #070913;
  color: #f5f7ff;
  min-height: 100%;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

#ui-bar {
  display: none;
}

#story,
#passages {
  margin: 0;
  max-width: none;
  padding: 0;
  width: 100%;
}

.passage {
  margin: 0;
  max-width: none;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 0;
  width: 100%;
}

.signal-scene {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 74% 42%, rgba(105, 81, 255, .2), transparent 25rem),
    linear-gradient(118deg, #090b1a 0%, #10142b 48%, #080914 100%);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(25rem, 1.05fr) minmax(22rem, .95fr);
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 4.5rem 7vw;
  position: relative;
}

.signal-scene::before {
  background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(214, 221, 255, .46) 0 1px, transparent 1.5px);
  background-size: 53px 47px;
  content: "";
  inset: 0;
  mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 8%, black 62%, transparent 100%);
  opacity: .34;
  position: absolute;
}

.signal-copy {
  align-self: center;
  max-width: 43rem;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

.signal-kicker,
.signal-location,
.signal-readouts {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.signal-kicker {
  color: #ffcb74;
  font-size: .72rem;
  letter-spacing: .24em;
  margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
}

.signal-location {
  color: #9ba9ff;
  font-size: .8rem;
  letter-spacing: .16em;
  margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
}

.signal-copy h1 {
  color: #f4f5ff;
  font: 650 clamp(3rem, 5.1vw, 5.7rem)/.92 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: -.065em;
  margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  max-width: 42rem;
}

.signal-copy p {
  color: #c8cee9;
  font: 1.08rem/1.7 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 37rem;
}

.signal-readouts {
  border-left: 2px solid #806cff;
  color: #949dbc;
  display: grid;
  font-size: .68rem;
  gap: .55rem;
  letter-spacing: .09em;
  margin: 1.6rem 0;
  padding: .2rem 0 .2rem 1rem;
}

.signal-readouts strong {
  color: #ffce7a;
  font-weight: 650;
}

.signal-links {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: .8rem;
  margin-top: 1.4rem;
}

.signal-links a,
.signal-links a:visited {
  background: #6951df;
  border: 1px solid rgba(211, 205, 255, .28);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: #fff;
  font: 650 .92rem/1 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  padding: .8rem 1.1rem;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.signal-links a:hover {
  background: #806cff;
}

.signal-orbit {
  align-self: center;
  aspect-ratio: 1;
  justify-self: end;
  max-width: 37rem;
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  z-index: 1;
}

.signal-orbit__ring,
.signal-orbit__core,
.signal-orbit__sweep {
  border-radius: 50%;
  position: absolute;
}

.signal-orbit__ring {
  border: 1px solid rgba(159, 173, 255, .26);
  inset: 8%;
}

.signal-orbit__ring--inner {
  border-color: rgba(255, 202, 112, .34);
  inset: 25%;
}

.signal-orbit__core {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 38% 35%, #fff1c8 0 3%, #ffb84f 8%, #744be8 29%, #11152d 69%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 6rem rgba(116, 75, 232, .52);
  inset: 36%;
}

.signal-orbit__sweep {
  background: conic-gradient(from 218deg, transparent 0 74%, rgba(151, 166, 255, .27) 88%, transparent 100%);
  inset: 13%;
}

.signal-orbit__label {
  background: rgba(7, 9, 20, .74);
  border: 1px solid rgba(160, 173, 255, .23);
  bottom: 13%;
  color: #afb9ff;
  font: .66rem/1.4 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  letter-spacing: .13em;
  padding: .55rem .7rem;
  position: absolute;
  right: 0;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.signal-scene--relay {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 72% 38%, rgba(255, 156, 69, .2), transparent 25rem),
    linear-gradient(118deg, #100b13 0%, #251325 50%, #0c0a14 100%);
}

.signal-scene--relay .signal-orbit__core {
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 38% 35%, #fff5d3 0 4%, #ff9c45 12%, #8d355f 35%, #18101d 70%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 6rem rgba(255, 128, 69, .38);
}

.signal-scene--contact {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 72% 38%, rgba(57, 222, 190, .2), transparent 25rem),
    linear-gradient(118deg, #071013 0%, #09252a 50%, #060c13 100%);
}

.signal-scene--contact .signal-orbit__core {
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 38% 35%, #ebfff9 0 4%, #39debe 12%, #28758c 35%, #07151b 70%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 6rem rgba(57, 222, 190, .38);
}

:: StoryInit
<<set $signalStrength = 37>>
<<set $contactStatus = "unverified">>
<<set $dishLocked = false>>
<<set $contactLog = []>>

:: Signal Deck [opening nobr]
<<set _scanWindow = "03:17–03:29">>
<<set $contactLog.push("Signal Deck")>>
<<run console.info("Night Signal passage: Signal Deck")>>
<div class="signal-scene signal-scene--deck">
  <section class="signal-copy">
    <div class="signal-kicker">Night Signal · SugarCube Runtime Lab</div>
    <div class="signal-location">Relay Array 06 · Periapsis</div>
    <h1>Something answered the listening array.</h1>
    <p>A narrow-band pulse repeats beyond the moon, too regular for weather and too patient for noise. The dish is still drifting toward its source.</p>
    <div class="signal-readouts">
      <span>signal <strong>37%</strong></span>
      <span>contact <strong>unverified</strong></span>
      <span>scan window <strong>12 minutes</strong></span>
    </div>
    <div class="signal-links">[[Lock the relay dish->Relay Lock]]</div>
  </section>
  <div class="signal-orbit" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="signal-orbit__ring"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__ring signal-orbit__ring--inner"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__sweep"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__core"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__label">candidate source · 18h 42m 09s</div>
  </div>
</div>

:: Relay Lock [relay nobr]
<<set _phaseOffset = "+0.0042">>
<<set $dishLocked = true>>
<<set $signalStrength = 82>>
<<set $contactStatus = "structured">>
<<set $contactLog.push("Relay Lock")>>
<<run console.info("Night Signal passage: Relay Lock")>>
<div class="signal-scene signal-scene--relay">
  <section class="signal-copy">
    <div class="signal-kicker">Night Signal · SugarCube Runtime Lab</div>
    <div class="signal-location">Relay Lock · Phase +0.0042</div>
    <h1>The noise resolves into a map.</h1>
    <p>Three tones sketch an orbit around an invisible body. Between them, a fourth signal carries the cadence of a question.</p>
    <div class="signal-readouts">
      <span>signal <strong>82%</strong></span>
      <span>dish <strong>locked</strong></span>
      <span>contact <strong>structured</strong></span>
    </div>
    <div class="signal-links">
      [[Answer the signal->First Contact]]
      [[Release the dish->Signal Deck]]
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="signal-orbit" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="signal-orbit__ring"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__ring signal-orbit__ring--inner"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__sweep"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__core"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__label">phase lock · stable</div>
  </div>
</div>

:: First Contact [contact nobr]
<<set _replyLength = 13>>
<<set $signalStrength = 100>>
<<set $contactStatus = "acknowledged">>
<<set $contactLog.push("First Contact")>>
<<run console.info("Night Signal passage: First Contact")>>
<div class="signal-scene signal-scene--contact">
  <section class="signal-copy">
    <div class="signal-kicker">Night Signal · SugarCube Runtime Lab</div>
    <div class="signal-location">First Contact · Packet 001</div>
    <h1>The reply contains thirteen stars.</h1>
    <p>They arrive as coordinates, then brighten into a route home. The final point is the listening array itself—marked long before it was built.</p>
    <div class="signal-readouts">
      <span>signal <strong>100%</strong></span>
      <span>contact <strong>acknowledged</strong></span>
      <span>reply <strong>13 coordinates</strong></span>
    </div>
    <div class="signal-links">[[Begin another scan->Signal Deck]]</div>
  </section>
  <div class="signal-orbit" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="signal-orbit__ring"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__ring signal-orbit__ring--inner"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__sweep"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__core"></div>
    <div class="signal-orbit__label">reply decoded · 13 points</div>
  </div>
</div>
